1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,840
Stop!

17
00:00:57,119 --> 00:00:58,600
How many times have I told you?

18
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:01,960
The three of us are in this together.

19
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,600
If you keep acting recklessly

20
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:04,719
and ruin the whole plan,

21
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,840
we won't get our hands on
anything the Lu family owns.

22
00:01:07,079 --> 00:01:08,079
We'll lose our lives too.

23
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:10,840
I know.

24
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:12,120
I was only fooling around.

25
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:13,719
You know me.

26
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,079
I wasn't going to go through with it.

27
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:25,040
=Episode 3=

28
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,519
Even if I did sleep with him,

29
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,760
it wouldn't affect your plan.

30
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:33,040
What are you so worried about,
Adjutant He?

31
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:35,040
Just complete your mission.

32
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:36,280
Don't cause trouble.

33
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,920
You'll have all the wealth
you could want.

34
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,599
You can control me,

35
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,200
but can you control
that young master of yours?

36
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,680
I'm only warning you for your own good.

37
00:01:58,719 --> 00:02:00,040
If you truly knew

38
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,599
what kind of man he is,

39
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:05,560
you'd never entertain that idea again.

40
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:12,000
If life at the Governor's Residence
is that unbearable,

41
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,639
and you do need a man
to keep you company,

42
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:19,680
I wouldn't mind satisfying you.

43
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,919
You thought I'd be interested in you?

44
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,960
Don't flatter yourself.

45
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:41,879
If you're that easy to scare,

46
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,159
don't go around seducing men.

47
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:26,520
Get out!

48
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,280
Get out!

49
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,960
Shaoyun.

50
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,680
Don't you hate me for killing them?

51
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,599
You did the right thing, Father.

52
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:42,000
Mother said I'm not your son.

53
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,680
(Young Lu Shaoyun)
Mother deserved to die.

54
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,719
How could I not be your son?

55
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:54,680
You really are different from them.

56
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,360
You've got guts
and know what's good for you.

57
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,919
You'll remain the young master

58
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:05,479
of the Governor's Residence.

59
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:13,759
(You likely suffered some trauma
as a child.)

60
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:16,399
(That's why you're unable
to have intercourse.)

61
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:18,199
(With current medical science,)

62
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,839
(it's difficult to cure.)

63
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,240
Sooner or later,

64
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:36,040
everything in this residence

65
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,480
will be mine.

66
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:44,840
(Guanghe Theater)

67
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:47,240
(Troupe Master)

68
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,920
You were kind enough to take me in
when I was young.

69
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,360
Now that I've rejoined my family,

70
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,079
I had to come and thank you.

71
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,639
I'm hardly worthy of such an honor.

72
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,600
It's kind of you to remember me, Ms. Lu.

73
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,000
Troupe Master.

74
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,079
Is that Kefu in there?

75
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,399
I didn't know

76
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:08,319
you and the governor were coming.

77
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,160
I'll have the mourning hall cleared away

78
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,199
so it won't bring you any bad luck.

79
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:15,000
This...

80
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,839
It's fine.

81
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:25,200
(Memorial Tablet of the Late Lin Kefu)

82
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:44,120
There was a fire backstage recently.

83
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,680
One of the girls in our troupe

84
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,720
didn't make it out.

85
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:49,680
She used to be Ms. Lu's partner.

86
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,959
(Kefu, I've come to see you off.)

87
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,600
(I brought your biological father
to see you off too.)

88
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,319
Kefu.

89
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,399
That's strange.

90
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,040
You always talk about your mother,

91
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,680
but never your father.

92
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,319
I don't know who my father is.

93
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,399
When Mother was still alive,

94
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:15,199
whenever I asked her,

95
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,600
she'd avoid the question.

96
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,600
Then maybe your father is still alive.

97
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,920
Maybe you'll meet him someday.

98
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:31,199
I just want to know who he is,

99
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:32,519
what he looks like,

100
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:33,839
and whether he's doing well.

101
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,519
That's all I want.

102
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:40,079
(Kefu, can you see him?)

103
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,560
(That's your biological father.)

104
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,439
You actually dared bring him here?

105
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,720
What if he gets suspicious?

106
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:05,800
(Shouldn't he be here to see
his own daughter off one last time?)

107
00:07:06,279 --> 00:07:07,399
Relax.

108
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,360
I just wanted Lu Zhentian to see

109
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,959
that I, his daughter,

110
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,759
am not the kind of person
who'd betray a friend for money.

111
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,120
You're playing with fire.

112
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,519
Father!

113
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:28,240
Father!

114
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,240
Ms. Lu!

115
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,160
Governor!

116
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,439
Why are people's fates so different?

117
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,720
Kefu and I suffered together growing up.

118
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,759
Now that I've found you,

119
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,319
I have a good life,

120
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:40,959
but she's gone.

121
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,720
You're truly a loyal friend, Ms. Lu.

122
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,160
But everyone has their own fate.

123
00:07:44,439 --> 00:07:46,199
You're a phoenix in the sky,

124
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,600
while Kefu

125
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,839
was just an ant below.

126
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:50,519
So don't grieve, Ms. Lu.

127
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:51,560
Father.

128
00:07:53,279 --> 00:07:54,319
This is Kefu.

129
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,240
She was so beautiful,

130
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:57,439
yet here she lies in this coffin.

131
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,279
It's so tragic.

132
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,079
Don't worry.

133
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,319
Butler Zhou.

134
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:08,160
Order her a fine coffin.

135
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:10,879
Let them keep the rest.

136
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,240
This...

137
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:15,160
On behalf of my disciples,
thank you for your generosity, Governor.

138
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,959
Enough.

139
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:16,720
Back to camp.

140
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,800
Safe travels, Governor.

141
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,600
Ms. Lu.

142
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:23,439
Why don't you come along?

143
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,439
Once you see what Lu Zhentian
is really like,

144
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,839
you'll realize how foolish
what you just did was.

145
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,000
(Move! Move! Run!)

146
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,200
(Keep moving!)

147
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,080
(Stop and you'll be shot!)

148
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:42,240
(Good!)

149
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,840
(Excellent shooting, Governor!)

150
00:08:47,039 --> 00:08:48,279
(Keep moving!)

151
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,200
(Faster!)

152
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,960
They're just ordinary civilians.

153
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:55,320
Why treat them like this?

154
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,480
The governor finds fixed targets boring.

155
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,159
Yesterday, a few careless villagers

156
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,639
damaged the governor's favorite car.

157
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,240
We brought them in
but hadn't decided what to do with them.

158
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:07,799
Now they can serve as targets
for the governor.

159
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:09,919
At least they'll die for a purpose.

160
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,279
Why can't they make a sound?

161
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:14,200
You must be joking, Ms. Lu.

162
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,399
The governor is training his hearing.

163
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:17,080
How could he train with them screaming?

164
00:09:17,399 --> 00:09:18,639
We poisoned them so they couldn't speak.

165
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:21,440
Good!

166
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,879
Excellent shooting, Governor!

167
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,159
What?

168
00:09:35,159 --> 00:09:37,879
Do you see it differently, Ms. Lu?

169
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,960
Good!

170
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,480
Yutang.

171
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:50,039
Come see the armory with me.

172
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,519
Adjutant He, we owe you our lives.

173
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,559
We'll repay you in our next life.

174
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:00,799
Enough.

175
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:03,679
Adjutant He doesn't need repayment.

176
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,320
But if you breathe a word

177
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,120
about today's switch...

178
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,159
We won't!

179
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,519
We definitely won't!

180
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,200
(Staff Officer Chen)
Enough, Zhaolin.

181
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,360
Take them out.

182
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,200
Get them safely out of the city.

183
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,279
Then change out of
those military uniforms.

184
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:16,399
Yes.

185
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,600
Come with me.

186
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,559
Those human targets...

187
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,639
Don't worry.

188
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,919
Their faces were disfigured.

189
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:29,159
They were condemned prisoners
awaiting execution.

190
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,320
They deserved it.

191
00:10:32,279 --> 00:10:32,919
All right.

192
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:33,759
Let's go.

193
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:35,360
Let's see that girl you found.

194
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,320
Governor.

195
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,799
Are we heading back already?

196
00:10:40,159 --> 00:10:41,000
Jingchen.

197
00:10:41,279 --> 00:10:43,360
Lady Feng may be pregnant.

198
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,320
Why didn't Adjutant He tell me sooner
the Governor could still have children?

199
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,680
(Governor's Residence)

200
00:10:51,919 --> 00:10:52,840
Yanyan.

201
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,240
(Feng Yanyan)
Take good care of yourself and the baby.

202
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:55,919
Give me a son,

203
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:57,879
and I'll make you my principal wife.

204
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,000
Yutang.

205
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,480
Pay your respects to Lady Feng.

206
00:11:03,399 --> 00:11:04,600
Greetings, Lady Feng.

207
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:06,320
May you be blessed with a son,

208
00:11:06,559 --> 00:11:07,759
and bring an heir to
the Governor's Residence.

209
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,440
Thank you for your kind wishes, Ms. Lu.

210
00:11:11,679 --> 00:11:12,279
Good.

211
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:37,440
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

212
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:42,080
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

213
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:45,240
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

214
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:47,760
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

215
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:52,120
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

216
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:58,080
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

217
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,800
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

218
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:06,280
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

219
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,600
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

220
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:11,840
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

221
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:18,520
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

222
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:22,120
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

223
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:25,320
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

224
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:31,840
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

225
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:35,240
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

226
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:38,560
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

227
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:41,400
♪Boundless♪
